safix: the mapping 'grafana' mirrors grafana-password for ana into the database, and it holds
no value yet. Nothing was written.

secrets/safix/users/ana/secrets.yaml does not carry the key. Evaluation could not have caught this: an
entry declares where a value lives, not that one is there.

Give it a value, then re-run:

    safix set ana grafana-password
